{"id":"615167","name":"口袋饼","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"","cover":"images/615167/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"冷开水","amount":"50g"},{"name":"50度温开水","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"植物油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"克面粉中一半用冷水搅拌成絮，一半用温水搅拌成絮，再混合在一起，和成光滑面团。","img":"images/615167/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"醒十五分钟。","img":"images/615167/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"醒好的面团。","img":"images/615167/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"面条揉成条，切成8个剂子。","img":"images/615167/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"擀成牛舌状。","img":"images/615167/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"用喷油壶喷些植物油。","img":"images/615167/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"对半折。","img":"images/615167/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅预热，不放油，将饼子放入锅中小火烙。","img":"images/615167/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"两面烙黄。","img":"images/615167/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"夹菜夹肉，都很美味。","img":"images/615167/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}